000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. CTIMTRAC.
000400 AUTHOR.     C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN. MARCH, 1989.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*
001100*    THIS SUBPROGRAM IS USED IN TO CALCULATE THE ELAPSED TIME
001200*    BETWEEN SPECIFIED POINTS IN A PROGRAM.  THIS IS USED TO
      *    PINPOINT A PERFORMANCE PROBLEM.  THE COPY MEMBER
      *    'CTIMTRAC' MUST BE ADDED TO WORKING STORAGE OF THE TRACED
      *    PROGRAM, 'XTIMTRAC' TO THE BOTTOM, AND THE FOLLOWING
      *    STATEMENTS MUST BE INSERTED AT EACH TRACE POINT:
      *        MOVE 1 TO TRACE-POSITION.
      *        PERFORM 9999-TIME-TRACE.
      *    AT THE END OF THE PROGRAM, THEN CALL 'CTIMTRAC' TO
      *    PRINT THE RESULTS.
001700*
006800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
006900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
007000 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
007100 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
007200 SPECIAL-NAMES.
007300     C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
007400
007500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
007600 FILE-CONTROL.
007700     SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
007900 DATA DIVISION.
008000 FILE SECTION.
008100
008200 FD  ONLINE-PRT
008300     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
008400     RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
008500     DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RCD.
008600 01  PRINT-RCD.
008700     05  PRINT-LINE           PIC X(132).
008800
008900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  BIGEST-SUB       PIC 9(3).
       01  ELAPSED-TIME.
           05  HH           PIC X(2).
           05  MM           PIC X(2).
           05  SS           PIC X(2).
           05  FF           PIC X(2).

       01  DETAIL-LINE-1.
           05  FIL              PIC X(6)  VALUE " FROM ".
           05  PRT-TRACE-POS-1  PIC Z9.
           05  FIL              PIC X(4)  VALUE " TO ".
           05  PRT-TRACE-POS-2  PIC Z9.
           05  FIL              PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-TRACE-ELAPSED.
               10  HH           PIC X(2).
               10  FIL          PIC X(1)  VALUE ":".
               10  MM           PIC X(2).
               10  FIL          PIC X(1)  VALUE ":".
               10  SS           PIC X(2).
               10  FIL          PIC X(1)  VALUE ":".
               10  FF           PIC X(2).
           05  FILLER           PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-TIME-1       PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER           PIC X(3)  VALUE " - ".
           05  PRT-TIME-2       PIC X(8).

       01  SUB                  PIC 9(3).
       01  SUB2                 PIC 9(3).
009000
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY CTIMTRAC IN COPYCSIS.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CTIMTRAC-PARMS.
       6000-MAIN.
           MOVE ZERO TO SUB, SUB2.
           MOVE 0 TO TRACE-SUB.
           OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-PRT.
           PERFORM 7000-SUBTRACT-TIMES THRU 7090-ST-X 499 TIMES.

           CALL "CSUBTIME" USING TRACE-TIME (BIGEST-SUB),
                                 TRACE-TIME (1),
                                 ELAPSED-TIME.
           MOVE 1 TO PRT-TRACE-POS-1.
           MOVE TRACE-POS (BIGEST-SUB) TO PRT-TRACE-POS-2.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING ELAPSED-TIME TO PRT-TRACE-ELAPSED.
           MOVE TRACE-TIME (1) TO PRT-TIME-1.
           MOVE TRACE-TIME (BIGEST-SUB) TO PRT-TIME-2.
           MOVE DETAIL-LINE-1 TO PRINT-RCD.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD AFTER ADVANCING 2.

           CLOSE ONLINE-PRT.
           GOBACK.

       7000-SUBTRACT-TIMES.
           ADD 1 TO SUB.
           ADD 1 TO SUB GIVING SUB2.
           IF TRACE-TIME (SUB) NOT NUMERIC
           OR TRACE-TIME (SUB2) NOT NUMERIC
               GO TO 7090-ST-X.
           MOVE SUB2 TO BIGEST-SUB.
           CALL "CSUBTIME" USING TRACE-TIME (SUB2),
                                 TRACE-TIME (SUB),
                                 ELAPSED-TIME.
           MOVE TRACE-POS (SUB) TO PRT-TRACE-POS-1.
           MOVE TRACE-POS (SUB2) TO PRT-TRACE-POS-2.
           MOVE CORRESPONDING ELAPSED-TIME TO PRT-TRACE-ELAPSED.
           MOVE TRACE-TIME (SUB) TO PRT-TIME-1.
           MOVE TRACE-TIME (SUB2) TO PRT-TIME-2.
           MOVE DETAIL-LINE-1 TO PRINT-RCD.
           WRITE PRINT-RCD AFTER ADVANCING 1.
       7090-ST-X.
           EXIT.
